@segment 39-40 Badlands, Alterac, Arathi II & Level 40
@start-level 39
# Skyborne Mage segment (the Skyborne Druid route's segment 16 with the class parts replaced; same quests, order and binds).
# Carried in (segment 15's carry-out): 707 Ironband Wants You! (Loch Modan), 1106 Martek the Exiled (Badlands), 525 Further Mysteries
# (Southshore). 209 (Booty Bay), 212 (Stormwind), 1111 and 1178 (Ratchet) ride along.
@carry 209,212,525,707,1106,1111,1178,1949
# Prerequisites handed in by earlier segments: 514 -> 525, 510 -> 512 Noble Deaths, 690 -> 691 Worth Its Weight in Gold,
# 189 -> 209, 1176 -> 1178.
@done 189,510,514,690,1176
# Hearth: Booty Bay at the start (do not use it), Southshore from the Southshore stop on.
# Trainer: Jennea Cannon in Stormwind at 40, at the end of the Arathi round (level 38 was trained at Bink in Ironforge, the last
# step of segment 15, so the segment starts in Ironforge with the flight to Thelsamar).
# Deviations from the druid source:
# - The druid's training trip after Faldir's Cove is now Teleport: Stormwind (level 40 spells from Jennea Cannon; the Portal
#   Trainer beside her teaches the level 40 portals) + Hearthstone to Southshore. The Hearthstone was last used after the
#   Alterac round; all of Arathi and Faldir's Cove lie between (hours).
# - Mount: the Skyborne riding trainer and mount vendor are not in the data (unverified). The N step that says so moved up
#   three steps, into the Stormwind training stop: that is the one moment of this segment with city guards to ask.
# - All hints rewritten for a mage (plain walks and swims; Counterspell instead of a stun; no self-heals).
# - As in the druid source there is no Ironforge / Dun Morogh ranch ending: Southshore -> Menethil Harbor by gryphon, then the
#   boat to Theramore (a teleport cannot replace that leg).
# Carry-out (6): 669 Sunken Treasure (Fleet Master Seahorn, Booty Bay) and 1137 News for Fizzle (Shimmering Flats, next segment),
# plus 209, 212, 1111, 1178.
# Corrected against the plan from the item data: Ryedol's Lucky Pick drops from the Shadowforge dwarves (not the Camp Kosh ogres),
# the Supply Crate stands in Camp Kosh (not Angor Fortress), Scrap Metal drops from Dustbelcher ogres (not the dwarves).
# Skipped on purpose: 704 and the other Uldaman quests, the elite 705/706/717/735/762, 713/714, 732, 504 and 652 (elite),
# 694 and later (elite), 670/667 (Booty Bay round trip).

# ---------- Ironforge and Thelsamar ----------
FLY Thelsamar @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7 | Gryth Thurden, the Ironforge gryphon master. Count your gold: at level 40, at the end of this segment, riding and a mount cost about 100 gold.
A 2500 | Ghak Healtouch, the alchemist in Thelsamar
T 707 | Prospector Ironband, at Ironband's Excavation Site in the south-east of Loch Modan
A 738 @ Loch Modan, 65.9, 65.6 | Prospector Ironband

# ---------- Badlands ----------
N Walk south into the Badlands @ Badlands, 53.8, 43.3 | On foot. The pass leaves Loch Modan at its south end (Classic geography, not re-checked) and comes out in the north of the Badlands. Head south to the two dwarves camped in the open south of Hammertoe's Dig Site. On the way, start on Ghak's list: Crag Coyotes (35-36) for fangs and Starving Buzzards (35-37) for gizzards.
A 718 | Sigrun Ironhew
A 719 | Prospector Ryedol, next to him
C 719 @ Badlands, 53.4, 32.5 | Ryedol's Lucky Pick drops from the Shadowforge dwarves (Tunnelers and Darkweavers, 35-37) at Hammertoe's Dig Site, a short way north. Counterspell the Darkweavers' casts.
C 718 @ Badlands, 66.9, 23.5 | The Supply Crate stands in Camp Kosh, the ogre camp in the north-east. The Dustbelcher Warriors and Mystics there are 36-37: clear your way to the crate and loot it.
T 718 | Sigrun Ironhew
A 733 | Sigrun Ironhew. Scrap Metal drops from every Dustbelcher ogre: you meet them in the south and south-west on the round below.
T 719 | Prospector Ryedol
T 1106 | Martek the Exiled, at the small racing camp in the Valley of Fangs, south-west of the dwarves
A 1108 | Martek the Exiled
A 703 | Rigglefuzz, the goblin next to Martek
A 710 | Lotwil Veriatus, at his camp in the west of the Badlands. Kargath, further west, is a Horde outpost: stay clear of it.
C 710 @ Badlands, 18.8, 43.0 | 10 Small Stone Shards from the Lesser Rock Elementals (37-39) on the slopes west of Lotwil's camp. Rock Elemental Shards for Ghak drop from the same elementals.
T 710 | Lotwil Veriatus
A 711 | Lotwil Veriatus
C 711 @ Badlands, 30.0, 62.0 | 3 Large Stone Slabs from Rock Elementals (39-40), which roam the plain south and south-east of Lotwil. Giant Buzzards (39-41) and Elder Crag Coyotes (38-40) share the area: wings, gizzards and fangs.
T 711 | Lotwil Veriatus
A 712 | Lotwil Veriatus
C 712 @ Badlands, 8.3, 82.8 | 5 Bracers of Rock Binding from Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) in the far south-west corner. They are 3-4 levels above you and your spells will often be resisted: one at a time, Frostbolt from full range, Frost Nova when it reaches you (it may be resisted too), Blink away and keep casting; Mana Shield early, eat and drink after every fight. The Dustbelcher ogres camped just north of them (40-43) drop Scrap Metal. If the elementals are too much, abandon this part and skip its hand-in.
T 712 | Lotwil Veriatus
T 738 | The Battered Dwarven Skeleton at Agmond's End, in the south of the Badlands. Walk east along the south side; Dustbelcher Ogres and Brutes (38-40) on the way drop Scrap Metal.
A 739 | The Battered Dwarven Skeleton
C 739,1108 @ Badlands, 50.4, 68.3 | The trogg camp right behind the skeleton: kill 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers (39-40) and Murdaloc (42), who walks among them. Bonesnappers and Stonevault Shamans drop the 10 Indurium Flakes. Clear the troggs near Murdaloc first, then fight him alone: Frostbolt, Frost Nova and step back, Mana Shield if he stays on you. Counterspell the Stonevault Shamans' heals.
C 703,2500 @ Badlands, 54.5, 62.9 | Finish the animal parts around Agmond's End: 4 Buzzard Wings and 5 Buzzard Gizzards (Buzzards, 37-39), 10 Crag Coyote Fangs (Feral Crag Coyotes, 37-38) and 5 Rock Elemental Shards (any rock elemental).
T 1108 | Martek the Exiled
A 1137 @ Badlands, 42.2, 52.7 | Martek the Exiled. News for Fizzle at the Mirage Raceway: keep it for the next segment.
T 703 | Rigglefuzz
C 733 @ Badlands, 66.2, 23.3 | Still short of 7 Scrap Metal? The Dustbelcher Warriors and Mystics at Camp Kosh in the north-east are the easy source. Otherwise go straight to Sigrun.
T 733 | Sigrun Ironhew
T 739 | Prospector Ironband: back north over the pass into Loch Modan. Do not take the follow-up (Uldaman).
T 2500 | Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar

# ---------- Southshore and the Alterac Mountains ----------
FLY Ironforge @ Loch Modan, 33.9, 51.0 | Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar. In Ironforge fly straight on to Southshore.
FLY Southshore @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7 | Gryth Thurden
S Southshore @ Hillsbrad Foothills, 51.2, 58.9 | Innkeeper Anderson
T 525 | Magistrate Henry Maleb, in the town hall
A 537 | Magistrate Henry Maleb
A 512 | Magistrate Henry Maleb
A 500 | Marshal Redpath, outside by the barracks
A 659 | Phin Odelic, in the inn building
C 512 @ Alterac Mountains, 60.9, 44.1 | Walk north into the Alterac Mountains. Syndicate Spies and Wizards (34-36) at Sofera's Naze and Corrahn's Dagger, the two camps in the south-east, drop Alterac Signet Rings; you need 7. Counterspell the Wizards' casts and Polymorph a second one.
C 537:1 @ Alterac Mountains, 57.9, 35.1 | 4 Argus Shadow Mages (35-36): around Strahnbrad, the ruined town north of the camps. The Syndicate Sentries and Saboteurs there drop rings too.
C 537 @ Alterac Mountains, 39.2, 14.3 | Nagaz (40) is in the house at Dandred's Fold, in the north-west of the zone. Follow the road west and north around the ruined city. Syndicate Assassins and Enforcers (38-40) guard the farm: pull them away from the house one at a time (Polymorph a second one), then fight Nagaz alone and Counterspell his shadow spells. Take his head.
C 500 @ Alterac Mountains, 50.0, 45.0 | 9 Dirty Knucklebones from Crushridge Ogres and Brutes (34-36) in the outer parts of the Ruins of Alterac, on the way back south. Stay out of the city centre and the western slope: those ogres are elite.
H Southshore | Hearthstone
T 500 | Marshal Redpath. Do not take Crushridge Warmongers (elite).
T 512 | Magistrate Henry Maleb
T 537 | Magistrate Henry Maleb

# ---------- Arathi Highlands ----------
N Walk east into the Arathi Highlands @ Arathi Highlands, 46.2, 47.8 | On foot. Take the road east out of Hillsbrad, through the gap in Thoradin's Wall, and on to Refuge Pointe in the middle of Arathi.
A 691 | Apprentice Kryten at Refuge Pointe
T 659 | Quae, on the hill above the Go'Shek Farm, east of Refuge Pointe. She and Kinelory stand there in stealth-coloured gear, easy to miss.
A 658 | Quae
C 658 @ Arathi Highlands, 52.5, 61.5 | The Forsaken Courier walks the road between Go'Shek Farm and the south-west with four bodyguards (all about 35). They are well below you, but five at once still hurts: Mana Shield up, Frost Nova all five as they reach you, step back and Blizzard them, then Cone of Cold and Arcane Explosion what is left. Make sure the courier dies and loot her Sealed Folder.
T 658 | Quae
A 657 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.8 | Quae
T 657 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.9 | Kinelory, beside her
A 660 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.9 | Kinelory
C 660 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.9 | Escort Kinelory down into the Go'Shek Farm and back. She fights well, and you cannot heal her: kill what attacks her (Forsaken, about 33-36) and stay with her until she is back with Quae.
T 660 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.8 | Quae
A 661 @ Arathi Highlands, 60.2, 53.8 | Quae. Goes to Phin Odelic in Southshore at the end of the Arathi round.
A 642 | The Shards of Myzrael, a crystal on the hillside north of the farm
C 642 @ Arathi Highlands, 80.0, 36.0 | 12 Motes of Myzrael from the Drywhisker kobolds (35-38) in Drywhisker Gorge, in the north-east corner
T 642 | The Iridescent Shards, the big crystal at the back of the Drywhisker cave
A 651 | The Iridescent Shards
C 651:2 @ Arathi Highlands, 66.7, 29.7 | Cresting Key: click the Stone of East Binding, the standing stone in the middle of the Circle of East Binding, and loot the key. Cresting Exiles (water elementals, 38-39) guard the circle: clear the ones near the stone.
C 691 @ Arathi Highlands, 66.6, 70.0 | Witherbark Village, in the south-east. 10 Witherbark Tusks from any troll, 4 Medicine Pouches from the Witch Doctors, and the Shadow Hunter Knife from a Witherbark Shadow Hunter (35-36) in the cave at the south end (68, 80). All of it is below your level.
C 651:3 @ Arathi Highlands, 52.0, 50.7 | Thundering Key: loot it from the Stone of Outer Binding in the Circle of Outer Binding, just east of Refuge Pointe. Thundering Exiles (air elementals, 38-39) guard it: clear the ones near the stone.
T 691 | Apprentice Kryten at Refuge Pointe
A 693 | Skuerto, a few steps from Kryten
C 693 @ Arathi Highlands, 54.8, 81.9 | Kor'gresh Coldrage (39) is in the cave at the back of Boulderfist Hall, the ogre mound in the south. The Boulderfist Brutes and Magi on the way are 35-37. Kor'gresh throws frost: Frost Ward up and Counterspell his casts. Loot Trelane's Wand of Invocation.
T 693 | Skuerto at Refuge Pointe. Stop here: the next part is elite.
C 651:1 @ Arathi Highlands, 25.5, 30.1 | Burning Key: loot it from the Stone of West Binding in the Circle of West Binding, in the north-west. Burning Exiles (fire elementals, 38-39) guard it: clear the ones near the stone.
T 651 | The Stone of Inner Binding, in the small circle south of the road and east of Stromgarde. Stop here: the next part (Breaking the Keystone) is elite.

# ---------- Faldir's Cove ----------
A 663 | Lolo the Lookout. Faldir's Cove is on the south coast: the path down starts south of the Inner Binding circle, west of the Thandol Span, and winds down the cliff to the beach.
T 663 | Shakes O'Breen, the captain on the beach
A 662 | First Mate Nilzlix
A 664 | Captain Steelgut
A 665 | Professor Phizzlethorpe
C 665 @ Arathi Highlands, 33.9, 80.5 | Escort the professor up to the cave above the cove and back. Daggerspine naga ambush him at the cave: Polymorph one, Frost Nova the others off him and kill them one by one. Stay close to him the whole way.
T 665 | Doctor Draxlegauge, beside the professor
A 666 | Doctor Draxlegauge. He gives you the Goggles of Gem Hunting.
C 664,662,666 @ Arathi Highlands, 22.0, 87.0 | Swim west along the coast to the two shipwrecks. Put on the goggles: they show the Calcified Elven Gems on the sea bed around the wrecks, collect 10. The Maiden's Folly (23.1, 84.8) and the Spirit of Silverpine (20.5, 85.4) each hold one chart and one log. Kill 10 Daggerspine Raiders (38-39) and 3 Sorceresses (39-40) between the wrecks: Counterspell the Sorceresses' casts, Polymorph a second naga, and come up for air between fights. Put your own helm back on afterwards.
T 662 | First Mate Nilzlix
T 664 | Captain Steelgut
T 666 | Doctor Draxlegauge
A 668 | Doctor Draxlegauge
T 668 | Shakes O'Breen
A 669 | Shakes O'Breen. A sample gem for Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay: keep it for a later Stranglethorn trip.
L 40 @ Arathi Highlands, 22.0, 87.0 | Not 40 yet? Stay with the Daggerspine naga at the wrecks until you are: the Stormwind training trip comes next, and the level 40 spells and the mount need level 40.
N Cast Teleport: Stormwind | One Rune of Teleportation. Your Hearthstone is ready again (last used after the Alterac round). Train first; the Hearthstone then takes you to Southshore.
TRAIN @ Stormwind City, 49.6, 85.8 | Jennea Cannon, the mage trainer in the Wizard's Sanctum: learn your level 40 spells. Larimaine Purdue, the Portal Trainer beside her (50.4, 86.0), teaches the portals from level 40 (group travel, not needed for the route). Buy Runes of Teleportation if you are low.
N Mount at level 40 | The current Questie data lists one Skyborne riding trainer: Genn Fairweather, "Stablemaster and Riding Trainer", on Zephras Isle (53.8, 81.3, on the south coast near Valanaar). How to get back to Zephras Isle from here is not known to me (you left on the skycutter to Dalaran): ask a city guard or another Skyborne whether there is a trainer or a way back nearer by, and have 100 gold ready. Until then you walk.
H Southshore | Hearthstone
T 661 | Phin Odelic, in the Southshore inn building

# ---------- Off to Kalimdor ----------
FLY Menethil Harbor @ Hillsbrad Foothills, 49.3, 52.3 | Darla Harris, the Southshore gryphon master
N Take the boat from Menethil Harbor to Theramore | You keep 1137 (Fizzle, Mirage Raceway), 1111 and 1178 (Ratchet), 669 and 209 (Booty Bay), 212 (Stormwind). Your hearthstone stays in Southshore until Gadgetzan.
